Simple Planes fold (diaithir-arms/aircraft/simpleplanes)

Derived from Simple Planes 5.3.9 by przemykomo (https://github.com/przemykomo/simple-planes,
commit 3b1617cbdd6a88c645f9af6fb1ebad6714fbc798), licensed LGPL-3.0-only (LICENSE-LGPL-3.0 here is the
upstream licence text, verified from the repository's LICENSE file).

What is derived: the upgrade catalogue (upgrade kinds, what each does, recipe shapes, fuel costs,
battery and tank sizes, solar output) and the helicopter flight constants, converted to SI units and
written as data (upgrades.json, helicopter.json, produced by gen_simpleplanes.py). No upstream Java,
models or textures are copied. Art for these upgrades is redrawn in the Industrial Factory style.
Changes from upstream: SI units, Age gates, Diaithir item ids, solar panel barred from helicopters
as upstream, plus the integration hooks listed in upgrades.json.

LGPL-3.0 section 4 applies to anything later built from this data: keep this notice and the licence text,
and mark changes.
